<<set $day = 2>>
<<declare $charname = "bby">>
You're still thinking about the elimination ceremony.
To be completely honest, you kind of panicked when the host asked you to choose.
You hope you made the right decision.
The host told you that there is no challenge today.
You (and the viewers) are supposed to get to know the eligible singles better.
Then you better go and do just that.
<<cam Camera2D>>
